---
/**
 * Preview entry of the "Ansprache" game (docs/plan/04-rueckruf-spiel.md), for showing it to Karo
 * before it is offered after an inquiry: `?ansprache` on any page opens it (`?rueckruf`, the first
 * name of the game, still works). The game is its own chunk (lib/ansprache/spiel.ts) and is only
 * fetched with the parameter, so normal pages carry just this loader.
 */
---
<script>
	const suche = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
	if (suche.has('ansprache') || suche.has('rueckruf')) import('../lib/ansprache/spiel').then((m) => m.oeffnen());
</script>
